; error: 6:10: a Int512 and int don't mix in arithmetic: a Int512 answers the operator with 'plus', which takes its own type on both sides; call the method, as in 'x.plus(y)', turning the other value into a Int512 first
; Int512 names the method instead.
include std/int512 {Int512, int512}
